<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-FRANCE LEAD SWEDEN 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRANCE LEAD SWEDEN 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Friday's singles matches in the Davis Cup final between Sweden and France:</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Stefan Edberg (Sweden) 6-3 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
